WEBVTT

00:03.128 --> 00:04.796
Breath of the Beast.

00:05.046 --> 00:08.508
Seventh Fang, Spatial Awareness.

00:25.859 --> 00:26.943
Did you find it?

00:27.277 --> 00:28.820
Yes, it's over there.

00:29.154 --> 00:31.406
I can sense
that they're incredibly strong.

00:31.698 --> 00:34.200
You're awesome, Inosuke.

00:38.329 --> 00:39.247
Damn.

00:39.330 --> 00:41.958
I'll have to deal with these people
if I want to go forth.

00:47.172 --> 00:48.131
Damn.

00:48.214 --> 00:51.593
Is there no way out of this?

02:41.744 --> 02:46.124
Nezuko...

02:46.708 --> 02:52.046
Where are you?

03:00.221 --> 03:01.806
Damn it!

03:02.348 --> 03:03.391
What a pain in the ass.

03:03.474 --> 03:05.268
I'm going to send them flying in one blow.

03:05.351 --> 03:06.728
No, don't even think about it!

03:06.853 --> 03:11.858
We have to think of something
so we don't have to hurt them.

03:16.905 --> 03:18.031
Mr. Murata.

03:18.448 --> 03:20.992
Leave this to me. You guys go ahead.

03:21.701 --> 03:23.995
Who are you kidding, Pissed-my-pants?

03:24.203 --> 03:26.956
Who are you calling Pissed-my-pants,
you stupid pig?

03:27.457 --> 03:30.293
I wasn't even talking to you, so shut up!

03:33.504 --> 03:35.757
I'm sorry that I've given you
such a bad impression,

03:35.840 --> 03:38.009
but I'm still a Demon Slayer.

03:38.176 --> 03:39.844
I'll do my best to stand my ground.

03:40.303 --> 03:42.889
I know that I just have
to cut those web strings.

03:43.056 --> 03:46.517
It's not so hard to predict
how they're used as puppets.

03:46.768 --> 03:48.603
I'll look out for the spiders too.

03:48.937 --> 03:53.149
When a demon is around,
it will probably puppet someone stronger.

03:53.483 --> 03:54.734
You two go now!

03:55.109 --> 03:57.111
I got it. Thank you!

03:57.695 --> 03:58.821
Let's go, Inosuke.

04:00.823 --> 04:02.533
Let go of me!

04:02.617 --> 04:04.661
I want to beat him up first!

04:04.744 --> 04:06.371
Who's a stupid pig?

04:06.454 --> 04:07.664
Shut up!

04:07.747 --> 04:09.666
Take your ramblings out of here!

04:09.791 --> 04:12.877
I'll be back to beat you up!

04:17.507 --> 04:20.551
Damn, I will totally beat him up.

04:20.635 --> 04:22.345
Stop talking about that.

04:22.428 --> 04:25.014
He called me a stupid pig, Monjiro.

04:25.098 --> 04:26.516
It's Tanjiro!

04:27.100 --> 04:29.394
By the way, is this the right way?

04:29.769 --> 04:32.188
My senses never betrayed me.

04:32.689 --> 04:33.898
But...

04:34.941 --> 04:37.610
What are these annoying threads
doing here?

04:38.653 --> 04:41.197
It shows that the demon is upon us.

04:44.492 --> 04:46.077
There's another one coming.

04:48.997 --> 04:50.039
No.

04:52.208 --> 04:54.919
Don't get past here.

04:55.837 --> 04:59.257
Go back and get the higher ranks here.

05:00.383 --> 05:03.428
If not, I'll get you all killed!

05:05.680 --> 05:06.764
Please.

05:08.224 --> 05:09.392
Please!

05:15.064 --> 05:17.317
I wonder if you'll be able to beat this.

05:18.359 --> 05:20.862
The closer you are to me,

05:21.154 --> 05:23.281
the thicker and tougher the threads,

05:23.406 --> 05:25.491
and the harder the puppets are to fight.

05:27.618 --> 05:28.786
Mom.

05:33.249 --> 05:34.625
Can you win this?

05:37.420 --> 05:38.463
Rui.

05:41.174 --> 05:43.843
It seems that you've wasted a lot of time.

05:50.892 --> 05:55.063
If you don't finish them now,
I'll tell Dad about this.

05:57.398 --> 05:59.567
It's okay. I got this covered.

05:59.692 --> 06:01.319
I'll protect you.

06:01.402 --> 06:03.321
So leave your dad out of this.

06:03.488 --> 06:04.572
Don't tell your dad.

06:04.655 --> 06:05.782
Your dad...

06:13.790 --> 06:15.708
Then, finish the job.

06:32.600 --> 06:34.560
Die, die!

06:34.727 --> 06:35.770
Die now!

06:36.020 --> 06:38.356
Otherwise, I'll be in big trouble.

06:41.818 --> 06:43.528
Run!

06:45.530 --> 06:46.447
That's fast.

06:46.989 --> 06:48.533
They caught me in their strings,

06:48.950 --> 06:52.662
so my moves are totally abnormal.

06:53.371 --> 06:57.458
We were never this strong to begin with.

07:07.343 --> 07:09.929
As they're controlled by demons
like puppets,

07:10.138 --> 07:12.140
they can still fight
even with broken bones.

07:18.604 --> 07:19.647
This is outrageous.

07:21.566 --> 07:23.025
This is one tough nut to crack.

07:23.276 --> 07:24.527
But then again...

07:25.862 --> 07:26.904
What's that noise?

07:30.992 --> 07:31.993
Kill...

07:32.535 --> 07:34.078
Kill us now.

07:35.079 --> 07:36.414
My limbs are broken.

07:36.747 --> 07:43.171
I could feel my bones
stabbing into my guts.

07:44.755 --> 07:46.424
They turned me into a puppet.

07:46.883 --> 07:49.677
I can't take these sharp pains anymore.

07:50.678 --> 07:54.307
We're heading for our doom anyway.

07:55.641 --> 07:57.059
Help me.

07:57.894 --> 08:01.063
Put me out of this misery.

08:02.857 --> 08:04.442
Sure thing!

08:05.067 --> 08:06.152
Wait!

08:07.111 --> 08:08.196
Wait a second.

08:08.321 --> 08:10.031
There must be a way to save them.

08:10.531 --> 08:11.866
Stop being so fussy.

08:13.117 --> 08:15.161
You're such a fusspot!

08:15.578 --> 08:16.621
But...

08:17.246 --> 08:20.082
You heard him say
to put him out of his misery.

08:23.878 --> 08:25.546
They're so fast.

08:25.630 --> 08:28.090
If we don't finish this soon,
we'll end up in shreds.

08:28.174 --> 08:29.383
I know.

08:29.467 --> 08:31.219
I'm thinking of a way, so please wait.

08:31.886 --> 08:33.387
I don't want to attack them.

08:33.721 --> 08:36.474
But even if I cut them off,
they'll string them up again.

08:37.141 --> 08:38.726
I have to stop that from happening.

08:40.478 --> 08:41.479
I got it!

08:43.356 --> 08:44.232
Hey!

08:49.320 --> 08:50.821
Good, she's coming for me.

08:51.739 --> 08:55.493
Why are you running in circles?

08:55.660 --> 08:57.078
Fooling around at a time like this?

09:04.126 --> 09:05.503
Total Concentration.

09:09.131 --> 09:10.550
What great power.

09:17.014 --> 09:19.267
Good, she's hung nicely.

09:22.937 --> 09:23.896
What...

09:25.398 --> 09:27.483
What was that?

09:27.608 --> 09:29.735
I want to try it too!

09:45.876 --> 09:47.169
Did you see that?

09:47.253 --> 09:50.172
If you can do it, so can I.

09:50.339 --> 09:52.717
Sorry, I didn't.

09:52.800 --> 09:53.926
What?

09:54.218 --> 09:56.178
I was too busy for that!

10:03.102 --> 10:04.270
Damn.

10:04.604 --> 10:07.148
All those puppets have failed me.

10:08.399 --> 10:10.735
Now it's all down to that puppet.

10:15.197 --> 10:18.409
Nezuko!

10:22.121 --> 10:25.708
Nezuko, where are you?

10:28.502 --> 10:30.004
Nezuko.

10:30.171 --> 10:31.505
Tanjiro.

10:31.839 --> 10:33.007
Wild boar.

10:33.341 --> 10:34.925
Chuntaro.

10:35.134 --> 10:37.178
Where are you guys?

10:37.470 --> 10:40.014
It's all my fault.

10:48.189 --> 10:49.482
Chuntaro.

10:51.817 --> 10:54.111
Did you come here for me?

10:54.195 --> 10:58.115
You're such a cute little friend,
although you're not as cute as Nezuko.

11:01.160 --> 11:02.912
It's all my fault.

11:02.995 --> 11:05.915
Okay, let's go find Nezuko.

11:10.961 --> 11:12.171
Hey, look!

11:12.254 --> 11:13.339
Can you see there?

11:13.422 --> 11:14.965
Mine is higher than yours.

11:15.049 --> 11:16.634
Yes, there's one left.

11:17.051 --> 11:20.346
Right, I'll show you one last time,
so don't miss it.

11:20.513 --> 11:22.223
Sure, go ahead.

11:22.390 --> 11:24.016
But don't get too rough.

11:24.308 --> 11:27.812
I don't need feeble human puppets.

11:28.020 --> 11:30.356
Humans are useless!

11:41.867 --> 11:44.787
Damn, she killed everyone.

12:08.060 --> 12:08.936
Let's go.

12:10.479 --> 12:11.772
You're right.

12:16.360 --> 12:17.403
This way.

12:17.570 --> 12:19.655
We're getting really close.

12:20.322 --> 12:21.699
The wind is changing.

12:21.991 --> 12:23.701
My keen sense of smell is coming back.

12:24.410 --> 12:26.495
That way, we'll know where the demon is.

12:27.830 --> 12:30.374
There are two scents here.

12:32.376 --> 12:33.335
Inosuke!

12:33.419 --> 12:35.463
I found it first.

12:35.713 --> 12:38.090
I will chop off its head!

12:47.183 --> 12:48.350
This guy...

12:49.393 --> 12:51.312
He's headless!

12:53.355 --> 12:57.318
Where are you, Nezuko?

13:05.284 --> 13:08.746
Where have you run to,
Tanjiro and Inosuke?

13:08.829 --> 13:12.041
Don't leave me alone
in this terrifying forest.

13:21.884 --> 13:23.010
What?

13:24.845 --> 13:27.681
I'm getting really mad.

13:28.933 --> 13:32.811
I have to find Nezuko
and leave this scary forest fast.

13:33.938 --> 13:36.941
Nezuko!

13:49.787 --> 13:51.497
He has no weak spots.

13:51.622 --> 13:53.249
We can't behead him.

13:54.625 --> 13:55.626
Inosuke.

13:55.876 --> 13:57.545
What should we do?

13:57.753 --> 14:00.256
Calm down and do a kesagiri.

14:00.506 --> 14:03.926
Cut on the right shoulder
and out through the left armpit.

14:05.052 --> 14:08.722
It's a wide range,
and it's probably rock solid.

14:09.932 --> 14:11.433
Wait, let's do it together!

14:12.059 --> 14:13.060
He's fast.

14:18.357 --> 14:20.192
But I can still dodge him!

14:21.569 --> 14:23.153
Crap, it's a spider!

14:26.365 --> 14:27.700
I can't move.

14:28.492 --> 14:29.618
I'm getting hacked!

14:44.425 --> 14:46.886
Inosuke, we're in this battle together.

14:46.969 --> 14:50.180
Let's think of a way to beat this demon.

14:50.639 --> 14:51.974
Let's fight him together.

14:52.892 --> 14:54.018
Damn you!

14:54.101 --> 14:57.605
Stop making me frizzy all over!

15:00.441 --> 15:02.026
Get out of my way!

15:03.819 --> 15:05.946
Inosuke, tread on me!

15:19.710 --> 15:22.463
Inosuke, jump!

15:26.216 --> 15:27.676
Total Concentration Breathing.

15:28.052 --> 15:29.261
Breath of Water.

15:29.887 --> 15:31.055
Fourth Form.

15:34.183 --> 15:35.392
Striking Tide!

15:41.273 --> 15:42.775
Do a kesagiri!

15:43.025 --> 15:46.528
Damn, this guy is getting into my nerves.

15:46.695 --> 15:48.697
I had to follow his orders all the time.

15:49.698 --> 15:52.117
As if everything is predetermined.

15:53.077 --> 15:57.039
As a matter of course like a river flow.

15:59.166 --> 16:02.628
He doesn't make his moves spontaneously,

16:02.962 --> 16:07.174
but he's observing
the whole course of the fight.

16:27.486 --> 16:29.363
Great, he slashed it.

16:29.738 --> 16:30.739
You did it.

16:30.823 --> 16:32.324
You defeated him, Inosuke.

16:37.705 --> 16:38.706
Inosuke?

16:44.003 --> 16:45.796
If you can do it,

16:45.879 --> 16:48.048
so can I, you idiot!

17:00.477 --> 17:01.812
This smell...

17:02.229 --> 17:04.231
I see what you mean, Inosuke.

17:06.108 --> 17:07.109
I lost.

17:07.276 --> 17:08.277
I'm defeated.

17:08.444 --> 17:11.071
That was my strongest, fastest puppet.

17:12.364 --> 17:15.367
If it weren't for Rui threatening me,

17:15.451 --> 17:18.704
I wouldn't have been
so anxious and jittery.

17:22.666 --> 17:23.667
Up there.

17:25.711 --> 17:28.213
Breath of Water, First Form.

17:28.922 --> 17:29.965
I'm finished!

17:30.049 --> 17:31.050
He's after my head.

17:31.133 --> 17:33.052
Quick, think of something.

17:37.848 --> 17:38.766
But...

17:40.309 --> 17:42.853
If I die, I'll be free.

17:48.108 --> 17:49.735
I can untie myself from all this.

17:52.946 --> 17:54.156
Fifth Form,

17:55.616 --> 17:57.117
Blessed Rain After the Drought.

18:06.752 --> 18:07.961
What is this?

18:09.963 --> 18:13.258
It feels like a tender spell of rain
showering over me.

18:15.761 --> 18:17.596
It doesn't hurt a bit.

18:18.222 --> 18:19.598
It's not painful at all.

18:20.390 --> 18:23.143
I only feel warmth.

18:26.188 --> 18:29.024
I didn't know I could greet death
in such a serene manner.

18:33.153 --> 18:36.406
Thus, I'm unbound.

18:48.127 --> 18:50.254
It's all my fault. I apologize.

18:50.337 --> 18:51.713
Please forgive me!

18:52.881 --> 18:54.424
Why are you angry at me?

18:54.591 --> 18:56.468
What did I do wrong?

19:01.223 --> 19:04.518
Your mistake is not knowing
why he is angry.

19:06.311 --> 19:08.564
How can that be? I'm just--

19:10.941 --> 19:13.986
Mom made Dad angry again.

19:21.952 --> 19:22.995
No.

19:23.078 --> 19:25.122
No! Please, don't!

19:40.304 --> 19:41.972
That look.

19:44.349 --> 19:45.851
It's so gentle.

19:49.062 --> 19:50.731
When I was a human,

19:51.315 --> 19:55.694
I think someone gazed at me
with such a gentle look.

19:58.238 --> 20:00.991
Who was it?

20:06.371 --> 20:07.956
I can't remember.

20:09.082 --> 20:12.419
But I think that person
has always cherished me.

20:16.924 --> 20:20.886
I wonder what he or she is up to.

20:32.814 --> 20:35.025
The Twelve Demon Moons are here.

20:38.237 --> 20:39.196
Wait!

20:40.906 --> 20:42.449
You must be careful.

20:50.791 --> 20:52.668
The Twelve Demon Moons are here.

20:54.086 --> 20:57.965
The real Twelve Demon Moons
are on this mountain.

22:34.186 --> 22:36.730
If you can do it, so can I.

22:36.897 --> 22:39.733
But I know that you're bad at one thing.

22:39.816 --> 22:40.734
What was that?

22:40.817 --> 22:43.612
You can't even remember my name, can you?

22:44.404 --> 22:46.364
Of course I remember your name.

22:46.448 --> 22:47.949
You're Gonpachiro Kamaboko!

22:48.033 --> 22:48.950
Wrong.

22:49.451 --> 22:51.536
-Gengoro Shakariki.
-No.

22:51.620 --> 22:53.955
-Tontaro Itadaki.
-That's way off.

22:54.206 --> 22:56.875
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

22:57.084 --> 23:01.463
I heard that Inosuke gets others' names
right once every seven times.

23:01.922 --> 23:03.632
You got my name wrong three times.

23:03.715 --> 23:05.175
Can you really nail it?

23:05.425 --> 23:06.718
Kanjiro Anago!

23:06.802 --> 23:07.803
You're getting close.

23:07.886 --> 23:08.970
Tangoro Hamado.

23:09.054 --> 23:09.971
A little off.

23:10.055 --> 23:11.098
Janjiro Amado!

23:11.181 --> 23:12.099
Just a little more!

23:12.182 --> 23:13.141
Tanjiro...

23:13.683 --> 23:15.936
It doesn't really matter
what your name is.

23:16.394 --> 23:18.480
You almost got my full name.

23:18.647 --> 23:21.983
Next, episode 17,
"You Must Master a Single Thing."

23:22.067 --> 23:24.194
You do your own thing and I do mine.

23:24.277 --> 23:25.612
You get that, Tanjiro?

23:26.905 --> 23:28.490
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.573 --> 23:29.658
Subtitle translation by CL Tan
